	</div>
	
	<div id="view-detail-data">
	<div style="background:#002b5e; color:white; padding:40px 20px; text-align:center; border-radius:10px 10px 0 0; border-bottom: 5px solid #ff9800;"><span style="display:inline-block; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); padding: 4px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px;">2026학년도 후기 (Fall 2026)</span>
<h1 style="margin:0; font-size:28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -1px;">일반대학원 외국인 특별전형<br />
<span style="color: #ffb74d;">2차 모집 안내</span></h1>

<p style="margin:12px 0 0 0; font-size:14px; color: #b3cde0; line-height: 1.5;">Graduate School Admission (2nd Round) for International Students<br />
2026年秋季一般大学院外国人招生（第二批）</p>
</div>

<div style="background:white; padding:40px 5%; border-radius:0 0 10px 10px; box-shadow:0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #ddd; border-top: none;">
<div style="background:#fff4e5; border: 1px solid #ffcc80; border-left:6px solid #ff9800; padding:20px; margin-bottom:40px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;"><span style="color:#c0392b;"><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #d35400;">※2026.07.17일이 제헌절로 지정됨에 따라 원서 접수가 16일로 변경되어 마감될 예정입니다.</strong></span></div>

<div style="background:#fff4e5; border: 1px solid #ffcc80; border-left:6px solid #ff9800; padding:20px; margin-bottom:40px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;"><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #d35400;">※ 첨부된 모집요강을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</strong><br />
<span style="display:block; margin-top:8px; color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">세부 지원자격, 제출서류, 학과별 모집여부 등은 첨부된 모집요강(PDF)에 상세히 기재되어 있습니다.</span> <span style="display:block; margin-top:2px; color: #777; font-size: 13px;">Please refer to the attached Admission Guidelines for detailed information. / 详情请参阅附件中的招生简章。</span></div>

<h2 style="color:#002b5e; border-bottom:2px solid #002b5e; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0; font-size: 20px;"><span style="color: #ff9800; margin-right: 5px;">■</span> 1. 모집 개요 <span style="font-size: 14px; color: #888; font-weight: normal;">(招生概要 / Admission Overview)</span></h2>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 14px; border-top: 2px solid #555;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-weight: bold; width: 25%; color: #333; background-color: #f9fafb; text-align: center;">모집과정</td>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; color: #222;">석사과정, 박사과정, 석·박사통합과정 / 신편입학</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-weight: bold; color: #333; background-color: #f9fafb; text-align: center;">지원자격</td>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; color: #222;">본인 및 친부모 모두 외국 국적을 가진 자로서 해당 학력요건을 충족하는 자</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-weight: bold; color: #333; background-color: #f9fafb; text-align: center;">모집학과</td>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; color: #222;"><strong>일부 학과</strong> <span style="color: #d9534f; font-size: 13px;">(※ 단, 학과별 세부 모집 여부는 반드시 모집요강 참고)</span></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<h2 style="color:#002b5e; border-bottom:2px solid #002b5e; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 20px;"><span style="color: #ff9800; margin-right: 5px;">■</span> 2. 전형 일정 <span style="font-size: 14px; color: #888; font-weight: normal;">(招生日程 / Admission Schedule)</span></h2>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 14px; border-top: 2px solid #555;">
	<thead>
		<tr style="background-color: #f0f4f8;">
			<th style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: center; width: 35%; font-weight: bold; color: #002b5e;">구분</th>
			<th style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: left; width: 65%; font-weight: bold; color: #002b5e;">일정 및 내역</th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-weight: bold; color: #333; background-color: #f9fafb; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">온라인 원서접수 및<br />
			원본 서류 제출</td>
			<td style="padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; line-height: 1.6;">
			<p><strong style="background-color: #ffebee; color: #c62828; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;">필수 동시진행</strong><br />
